Estágio O que faz Dependencies Dispara os jobs dos contratos dos quais o serviço depende Build <code>mvn clean package</code> Build &amp; Push Image Imagem multi-arquitetura (<code>amd64</code> e <code>arm64</code>) enviada ao Docker Hub com as tags <code>latest</code> e o número do build Deploy to K8s Atualiza a imagem do Deployment no EKS e aguarda o rollout <p>O estágio de deploy está implementado no <code>order-service</code>:</p> <pre><code>stage('Deploy to K8s') {
    environment {
        CLUSTER = 'eks-store'
        REGION = 'us-east-1'
        NAMESPACE = 'store'
    }
    steps {
        withCredentials([
            usernamePassword(credentialsId: 'dockerhub-credential',
                usernameVariable: 'USERNAME', passwordVariable: 'TOKEN'),
            usernamePassword(credentialsId: 'aws-credential',
                usernameVariable: 'AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID', passwordVariable: 'AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY')
        ]) {
            sh '''
                export KUBECONFIG="$WORKSPACE/.kubeconfig"
                aws eks update-kubeconfig --name "$CLUSTER" --region "$REGION"
                kubectl -n "$NAMESPACE" set image "deployment/$SERVICE" "$SERVICE=$USERNAME/$SERVICE:$BUILD_ID"
                kubectl -n "$NAMESPACE" rollout status "deployment/$SERVICE" --timeout=300s
            '''
        }
    }
}
</code></pre>
